WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.472
New York! We have a crazy challenge!

00:00:02.772 --> 00:00:04.956
We're making ONE giant pizza...

00:00:05.256 --> 00:00:07.416
...and feeding 100 PEOPLE with it!

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.472
Bro, this pizza is bigger than my apartment!

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.808
Stop talking! We still have to finish the toppings!

00:00:14.108 --> 00:00:16.340
Guys, we need MORE cheese!

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:18.008
BRING EVERYTHING!

00:00:18.308 --> 00:00:20.468
WAIT! WAIT! THE DOUGH IS TEARING!

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.160
Nobody panic! We can fix this!

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.536
You said this would be easy!

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.320
I NEVER SAID EASY!

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.056
Is it ready yet?

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:31.984
Almost!

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.840
Guys, if this pizza burns, we're eating 100 sad sandwiches!

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:38.052
IT'S READY!

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.896
NEW YORK! LOOK AT THIS!

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:46.376
That's the biggest pizza I've ever seen!

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:50.212
One hundred people... ONE giant pizza!

00:00:50.512 --> 00:00:51.784
That was actually amazing!

00:00:52.084 --> 00:00:53.212
Mission completed!

00:00:53.512 --> 00:00:54.736
What should we build next?

